  "title": "Instant Pot Pot Roast with Potatoes and Carrots",
  "description": "In your Instant Pot, carrots and potatoes cook alongside a delicious pot roast, then the drippings are thickened and cooked to make a savory gravy.",
  "authors": [
    "bdweld"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:31:50-04:00",
